+## Song names on the banner (main21 patch 135)
+
+A song of your folder gets the EA GAMES TRAX banner when it starts: title, artist and album from its tags (`xst_read_tags`: ID3v2 and ID3v1 in
+mp3, Vorbis comments in flac and ogg). No title tag: the name in the list. No artist tag: the soundtrack's (folder's) name. m4a and wav tags are not read. The font shows Latin-1,
